'''Chief Peng''' (ペ課長, ''Pe Kachō'', '''Manager Peng''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.7 Update|Version 2.0.7]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], he appears as a normal enemy, debuting in Chapter 2 [[Dubai (Empire of Cats)|Hiroshima]].

