==Enemy==
A variant of [[Jackie Peng]] with faster movement speed, attack rate and Area Attacks. Quite tough in groups as they can plow through your defenses. A 3-Crown Chief Peng is bordering on [[R.Ost]] and [[Bore]] levels of danger with extreme DPS and Area Attack, but thankfully with much lower health than the two.

==Strategy==
At lower buffs, this enemy is not dangerous even with his Area Attack, as he can be easily disposed of. However, like mentioned earlier, at higher buffs Chief Peng can be a real threat to your frontliners as he can easily plow through them if you lack high-leveled meatshields or enough damage to kill them quickly.

